<title>HONG KONG: Trade in Mansion Holdings shrs suspended.</title>
<headline>Trade in Mansion Holdings shrs suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of Mansion Holdings Ltd was suspended on Friday at the company's request pending for announcement, Hong Kong stock exchange said.  </p>
<p>The stock rose HK$0.22, or 24 percent, to close at HK$1.13 on Thursday.</p>
<p>Mansion Holdings is a fire prevention systems supplier.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6369.  http://www.hk97.com</p>
